---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="aicqtools — AI Code Quality Platform" locale="en">
  <h1>aicqtools</h1>
  <p>A unified code quality platform that <strong>deterministically validates AI-generated code</strong>.</p>

  <h2>What sets us apart</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Deterministic checks</strong> — 100% pass/fail without an LLM call</li>
    <li><strong>MCP-native</strong> — block AI code assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, etc.) before they generate violating code</li>
    <li><strong>AI agent rule auto-sync</strong> — `.cursorrules` / `CLAUDE.md` updated automatically</li>
    <li><strong>Korean domain ruleset bundled</strong> — FSC AI guidelines, PCI DSS, Korean IT conventions</li>
    <li><strong>MIT OSS, permanently free</strong> — any paid options (cloud dashboard, etc.) will be decided at v1.5</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>50 built-in rules</h2>
  <p>
    12 TypeScript globals + 10 Python globals + 7 Korean IT conventions + 5 FSC AI guidelines + 8 PCI DSS + 8 codebase dogfood. Full list at <a href="/en/rules">Rules</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Quick start</h2>
  <pre><code>{`pnpm add -D @aicqtools/cli
npx aicq check --locale en
npx aicq sync-ai-rules --locale en`}</code></pre>

  <p>Install / CI integration: <a href="/en/install">Install</a></p>
</Layout>
